1
00:00:19,074 --> 00:00:20,504
(As a "Damo" addict, I stayed tuned for the first time in a while.)

2
00:00:20,529 --> 00:00:22,569
("Ha Ji Won And Lee Seo Jin Spark Buzz As Show Hits Record Ratings")

3
00:00:22,569 --> 00:00:25,699
(The director of "Damo" left a comment as well!)

4
00:00:25,699 --> 00:00:26,869
- Seo Jin. - Ji Won.

5
00:00:26,869 --> 00:00:32,079
(The couple in "Damo" had a fateful reunion after 23 years.)

6
00:00:32,609 --> 00:00:35,809
(Call me Captain, Chae Ok.)

7
00:00:35,809 --> 00:00:38,549
(Why do I have to call you Captain?)

8
00:00:38,879 --> 00:00:40,519
(Why did you mess up my stuff like this?)

9
00:00:40,619 --> 00:00:41,949
(Give the plushie to me.)

10
00:00:42,089 --> 00:00:43,949
(I was an officer in the past,)

11
00:00:43,949 --> 00:00:45,819
(but I'm Ji Won's secretary now!)

12
00:00:45,819 --> 00:00:47,389
(Make it possible for me to meet the F1 drivers.)

13
00:00:48,229 --> 00:00:51,099
(Even if it means getting run over by a Ferrari, I'll make it happen.)

14
00:00:51,099 --> 00:00:53,929
(He'll do anything for Ji Won.)

15
00:00:53,929 --> 00:00:55,169
Ji Won has gotten much prettier, hasn't she?

16
00:00:55,369 --> 00:00:57,939
(After reuniting for the first time in a long while,)

17
00:00:57,939 --> 00:01:03,409
(they grew closer.)

18
00:01:07,509 --> 00:01:09,949
(She looks even prettier than before.)

19
00:01:10,849 --> 00:01:12,279
(It's our first time appearing on the same show...)

20
00:01:12,279 --> 00:01:13,449
(since "Damo.")

21
00:01:13,549 --> 00:01:17,149
He really tried hard to make sure...

22
00:01:17,149 --> 00:01:19,519
I had the best experience possible.

23
00:01:19,519 --> 00:01:22,359
(I was touched by how hard he tried.)

24
00:01:22,689 --> 00:01:25,629
(Their story, now deeper than ever, begins now!)

25
00:01:26,729 --> 00:01:28,769
- You did a good job. - My feet hurt.

26
00:01:28,769 --> 00:01:31,099
You did well, My Star.

27
00:01:31,899 --> 00:01:33,239
Why do I feel hungry?

28
00:01:33,239 --> 00:01:34,609
- Are you hungry? - Are you hungry?

29
00:01:34,669 --> 00:01:36,369
Shall we have a glass of wine here then?

30
00:01:36,369 --> 00:01:37,439
Sounds good.

31
00:01:37,439 --> 00:01:38,539
(11pm, the after-party at a hotel)

32
00:01:38,639 --> 00:01:40,539
- You did a great job. - You did a great job.

33
00:01:40,539 --> 00:01:41,709
(You worked hard today.)

34
00:01:42,079 --> 00:01:43,479
I think I got overheated.

35
00:01:43,479 --> 00:01:44,679
You got overheated?

36
00:01:45,019 --> 00:01:46,579
Well, I...

37
00:01:46,579 --> 00:01:47,889
(Laughing)

38
00:01:47,889 --> 00:01:50,019
I talked with them before going back to my room last night.

39
00:01:50,019 --> 00:01:51,819
I laughed so hard...

40
00:01:51,819 --> 00:01:52,989
my cheeks were hurting.

41
00:01:52,989 --> 00:01:54,359
(I laughed so hard.)

42
00:01:55,529 --> 00:01:57,229
Shall we have a drink here?

43
00:01:57,259 --> 00:01:58,429
What?

44
00:01:59,029 --> 00:02:00,059
My gosh.

45
00:02:00,059 --> 00:02:04,169
(They didn't want to say goodbye last night.)

46
00:02:04,269 --> 00:02:06,099
I was crying while holding her.

47
00:02:06,099 --> 00:02:10,739
(They stayed up late reminiscing about their days on "Damo.")

48
00:02:11,839 --> 00:02:19,279
(It was a time filled with just as much laughter as nostalgia.)

49
00:02:19,279 --> 00:02:21,589
I can't believe it was 23 years ago.

50
00:02:21,649 --> 00:02:23,149
Was it 23 years ago?

51
00:02:23,149 --> 00:02:25,759
(I can't believe it was 23 years ago.)

52
00:02:26,089 --> 00:02:28,059
This is the first time Ji Won and I have been on camera together...

53
00:02:29,589 --> 00:02:31,199
since "Damo."

54
00:02:31,199 --> 00:02:32,199
(It's their 1st on-screen appearance together in 23 years.)

55
00:02:32,199 --> 00:02:33,399
- Right. - Really?

56
00:02:33,629 --> 00:02:34,729
This is the first time.

57
00:02:35,069 --> 00:02:36,169
That's unbelievable.

58
00:02:36,169 --> 00:02:37,769
We never had a chance.

59
00:02:38,199 --> 00:02:41,269
The "Damo" addicts are looking forward to this.

60
00:02:41,269 --> 00:02:43,009
They're excited about our reunion.

61
00:02:43,409 --> 00:02:45,409
They'll go crazy.

62
00:02:45,939 --> 00:02:47,709
Even Son Suk Ku and Choi Hee Seo said...

63
00:02:47,709 --> 00:02:49,949
"Damo" was their favorite drama.

64
00:02:49,949 --> 00:02:50,979
Right.

65
00:02:51,149 --> 00:02:53,649
It's a masterpiece.

66
00:02:53,849 --> 00:02:54,919
Is that so?

67
00:02:55,289 --> 00:02:57,719
I should watch it again.

68
00:02:58,359 --> 00:03:00,559
So there was a scene like this.

69
00:03:02,289 --> 00:03:03,629
(Exclaiming)

70
00:03:03,629 --> 00:03:04,999
- Do you remember? - Yes.

71
00:03:05,459 --> 00:03:07,299
It's one of my favorite scenes.

72
00:03:07,799 --> 00:03:09,499
I like everything about this scene.

73
00:03:10,269 --> 00:03:12,499
I almost died that day.

74
00:03:12,539 --> 00:03:14,609
Why?

75
00:03:15,326 --> 00:03:17,626
(Seo Jin doesn't even want to think about that day.)

76
00:03:18,626 --> 00:03:20,196
I almost died that day.

77
00:03:20,926 --> 00:03:22,896
Three water trucks showed up that day.

78
00:03:23,766 --> 00:03:25,196
We filmed this scene all night.

79
00:03:25,936 --> 00:03:27,736
There were ten million bugs.

80
00:03:28,906 --> 00:03:30,106
(They have completely different memories of that same scene.)

81
00:03:30,106 --> 00:03:31,706
The lights attracted so many bugs.

82
00:03:32,006 --> 00:03:33,306
Wasn't it cold...

83
00:03:33,406 --> 00:03:34,846
that day?

84
00:03:34,976 --> 00:03:36,406
It was so cold.

85
00:03:36,676 --> 00:03:37,876
Wasn't it summer, though?

86
00:03:37,876 --> 00:03:40,176
But we got rained on...

87
00:03:40,176 --> 00:03:41,316
all night.

88
00:03:41,586 --> 00:03:42,946
Look how heavy the rain is.

89
00:03:43,846 --> 00:03:45,656
What am I to you?

90
00:03:46,016 --> 00:03:48,726
You're an officer I serve.

91
00:03:49,456 --> 00:03:50,826
Is that all I am to you?

92
00:03:51,096 --> 00:03:52,956
This scene is so good.

93
00:03:53,626 --> 00:03:57,126
Look at her hair. It looks like seaweed.

94
00:03:57,126 --> 00:04:00,636
It looks like seaweed.

95
00:04:01,166 --> 00:04:03,866
(Springing)

96
00:04:04,906 --> 00:04:06,676
Hit him.

97
00:04:06,906 --> 00:04:08,006
- Hit him. - My goodness.

98
00:04:08,006 --> 00:04:10,306
- Why would you say that? - Hit him.

99
00:04:11,246 --> 00:04:13,916
(Teasing Chae Ok is so fun.)

100
00:04:14,116 --> 00:04:16,286
Why did we fight back then?

101
00:04:16,816 --> 00:04:17,856
Why did we fight?

102
00:04:18,516 --> 00:04:21,386
I believe Hwangbo Yoon was jealous.

103
00:04:21,926 --> 00:04:23,886
No. We filmed the scene where I got jealous...

104
00:04:23,886 --> 00:04:25,596
in the barracks.

105
00:04:25,896 --> 00:04:26,926
I got jealous...

106
00:04:26,926 --> 00:04:28,396
after you returned from the cave.

107
00:04:28,466 --> 00:04:29,526
Yes. You were jealous at that time too.

108
00:04:29,526 --> 00:04:30,866
I was jealous at that time.

109
00:04:30,926 --> 00:04:32,266
Why did we fight in this scene then?

110
00:04:32,836 --> 00:04:34,436
He was always jealous.

111
00:04:34,606 --> 00:04:35,706
(He's jealous because he's being left out of their conversation.)

112
00:04:35,706 --> 00:04:37,166
It's because you kept putting yourself...

113
00:04:37,166 --> 00:04:39,636
- in danger... - I see.

114
00:04:40,006 --> 00:04:42,946
and doing reckless things. That's why I scolded you.

115
00:04:44,146 --> 00:04:45,916
Is that any reason to start fighting with swords?

116
00:04:47,786 --> 00:04:50,486
(Why don't you ever look after yourself?)

117
00:04:50,986 --> 00:04:53,256
(That's what I'm saying.)

118
00:04:53,616 --> 00:04:55,556
She ran away with Min Jun.

119
00:04:55,926 --> 00:04:57,426
Why? Did they fall in love?

120
00:04:57,656 --> 00:04:58,956
She changed her mind.

121
00:04:58,956 --> 00:05:01,226
She didn't want to go with me.

122
00:05:01,226 --> 00:05:02,426
(Chae Ok followed Jang Seong Baek instead of Hwangbo Yoon.)

123
00:05:02,666 --> 00:05:04,466
So I was like, "You'll have to cut me down to leave."

124
00:05:04,466 --> 00:05:05,466
"Cut me down."

125
00:05:05,466 --> 00:05:06,966
"Kill me if you want to leave."

126
00:05:06,966 --> 00:05:08,906
I know a familiar line. "Shoot me if you want to go."

127
00:05:08,906 --> 00:05:09,936
(A familiar line)

128
00:05:09,936 --> 00:05:11,006
Is that "Silmido?"

129
00:05:11,006 --> 00:05:12,576
(Is that "Silmido?")

130
00:05:12,576 --> 00:05:14,376
We filmed "Damo" before "Silmido" came out.

131
00:05:14,406 --> 00:05:15,476
You did?

132
00:05:17,346 --> 00:05:18,816
"Shoot me if you want to go."

133
00:05:18,816 --> 00:05:20,816
We filmed "Damo" before "Silmido" came out.

134
00:05:20,816 --> 00:05:21,946
You did?

135
00:05:23,216 --> 00:05:24,316
No.

136
00:05:24,456 --> 00:05:25,686
When I was attending...

137
00:05:25,686 --> 00:05:26,886
- an action school, - Okay.

138
00:05:27,216 --> 00:05:28,926
I trained with the "Silmido" team.

139
00:05:28,926 --> 00:05:30,186
So it was around the same time.

140
00:05:30,556 --> 00:05:31,796
We were doing it around the same time.

141
00:05:32,156 --> 00:05:35,496
Yes. I trained with the "Silmido" team back then.

142
00:05:36,226 --> 00:05:37,466
Bae Yong Joon,

143
00:05:39,036 --> 00:05:40,196
Ryoo Seung Bum,

144
00:05:41,206 --> 00:05:42,236
and the "Silmido" team...

145
00:05:42,906 --> 00:05:44,336
practiced together.

146
00:05:44,336 --> 00:05:45,576
(All of them went to the same action school.)

147
00:05:46,006 --> 00:05:47,506
(The behind-the-scenes stories from "Damo...")

148
00:05:47,506 --> 00:05:49,746
It makes me want to watch the drama.

149
00:05:49,746 --> 00:05:51,516
(are making him more curious.)

150
00:05:51,846 --> 00:05:54,986
Both of you were so young.

151
00:05:54,986 --> 00:05:57,216
- Ji Won was a little chubbier. - Yes.

152
00:05:57,446 --> 00:05:59,186
Yes. She still had some baby fat.

153
00:05:59,186 --> 00:06:00,186
(What's wrong with him?)

154
00:06:00,416 --> 00:06:03,586
Our captain, Young Master,

155
00:06:03,826 --> 00:06:05,026
was so young too.

156
00:06:05,826 --> 00:06:07,766
No. Do you remember what I told you yesterday?

157
00:06:08,726 --> 00:06:09,926
- Our first shoot. - Yes.

158
00:06:09,926 --> 00:06:11,396
- The fight scene in the snow. - Yes.

159
00:06:12,296 --> 00:06:14,736
When they switched from the child actor to me, I looked so old.

160
00:06:16,436 --> 00:06:19,206
(I remember.)

161
00:06:19,906 --> 00:06:22,176
Who was the child actor?

162
00:06:22,746 --> 00:06:23,946
Baek Sung Hyun.

163
00:06:24,246 --> 00:06:26,516
- I see. - And he transitions into me.

164
00:06:26,516 --> 00:06:27,886
Look how cute he is.

165
00:06:28,346 --> 00:06:30,516
Right? Ji Won will appear soon.

166
00:06:30,516 --> 00:06:31,556
- Is it my turn? - Now...

167
00:06:31,556 --> 00:06:33,816
Yes. She's all grown up now.

168
00:06:34,656 --> 00:06:35,826
- Is this... - Yes.

169
00:06:35,826 --> 00:06:38,796
- Ji Won looks good. - She's so cool.

170
00:06:38,796 --> 00:06:40,296
(My Star grew up to become a beautiful, strong woman.)

171
00:06:40,496 --> 00:06:41,766
Look at me now.

172
00:06:42,126 --> 00:06:43,726
I look like I committed high treason.

173
00:06:45,036 --> 00:06:46,436
I look like I committed high treason.

174
00:06:48,466 --> 00:06:51,306
(He had a beautiful smile.)

175
00:06:51,636 --> 00:06:56,876
(But he turned into a traitor.)

176
00:06:57,306 --> 00:06:59,316
(Laughing)

177
00:06:59,316 --> 00:07:01,586
Right? I look like a traitor.

178
00:07:02,746 --> 00:07:05,416
(Laughing hysterically)

179
00:07:06,016 --> 00:07:07,856
He does look like a traitor.

180
00:07:08,086 --> 00:07:09,886
I can't watch.

181
00:07:11,196 --> 00:07:13,496
(What on earth happened to Young Master?)

182
00:07:13,496 --> 00:07:14,996
I can't watch.

183
00:07:16,526 --> 00:07:20,166
(While Chae Ok hasn't aged a day,)

184
00:07:20,336 --> 00:07:24,936
(he looks like life has put him through the wringer.)

185
00:07:25,536 --> 00:07:27,436
That was my first appearance.

186
00:07:30,276 --> 00:07:33,146
(Dying of laughter)

187
00:07:33,276 --> 00:07:35,286
It's a masterpiece.

188
00:07:35,886 --> 00:07:38,656
Look at that. I don't even look Korean here.

189
00:07:39,756 --> 00:07:41,186
People might think I'm from Latin America or something.

190
00:07:41,186 --> 00:07:42,326
(He doesn't want to see his epic entrance scene again.)

191
00:07:42,326 --> 00:07:44,226
You look more like a mountain spirit.

192
00:07:44,996 --> 00:07:46,656
I can't ask them to film this scene again.

193
00:07:46,956 --> 00:07:48,566
You look more like a mountain spirit.

194
00:07:49,596 --> 00:07:51,296
Why did you have such a long beard?

195
00:07:52,096 --> 00:07:54,566
That's what I'm saying.

196
00:07:55,236 --> 00:07:57,066
They could've made it shorter.

197
00:07:57,066 --> 00:07:58,336
(Tell me about it.)

198
00:08:01,476 --> 00:08:02,646
This is crazy.

199
00:08:04,046 --> 00:08:05,746
(Laughing)

200
00:08:05,976 --> 00:08:09,386
What is this now?

201
00:08:09,716 --> 00:08:10,816
What's that?

202
00:08:12,586 --> 00:08:14,216
I was saving her.

203
00:08:14,786 --> 00:08:16,326
I was saving her.

204
00:08:17,356 --> 00:08:18,356
How?

205
00:08:20,126 --> 00:08:21,826
(Laughing like a dolphin twice in a row)

206
00:08:22,096 --> 00:08:24,696
(What is he doing?)

207
00:08:24,696 --> 00:08:27,366
I was sending my energy to save her.

208
00:08:27,596 --> 00:08:28,606
What?

209
00:08:30,036 --> 00:08:32,806
(A full-power energy healing session)

210
00:08:34,406 --> 00:08:38,976
(Was that scene this funny?)

211
00:08:39,246 --> 00:08:40,776
Is this a horror movie or something?

212
00:08:41,486 --> 00:08:42,546
What's this?

213
00:08:43,986 --> 00:08:47,416
(Trying hard)

214
00:08:47,716 --> 00:08:49,456
(Opening his eyes)

215
00:08:52,996 --> 00:08:54,926
(It definitely felt like such an emotional scene back then.)

216
00:08:54,926 --> 00:08:56,966
What's wrong with your face?

217
00:08:58,196 --> 00:09:00,066
This isn't CGI.

218
00:09:00,196 --> 00:09:01,436
I flew for real.

219
00:09:02,166 --> 00:09:03,236
Right?

220
00:09:03,366 --> 00:09:05,076
(Oh, right.)

221
00:09:05,076 --> 00:09:07,736
This isn't CGI. I flew for real.

222
00:09:07,906 --> 00:09:09,546
- He really did. - Yes.

223
00:09:13,176 --> 00:09:15,946
(Mr. Officer even flew by himself.)

224
00:09:15,946 --> 00:09:18,586
- How did you fly? - This was real too, right?

225
00:09:18,586 --> 00:09:20,886
They strapped me into a wire harness and pulled me up.

226
00:09:20,886 --> 00:09:23,326
(They pulled me up.)

227
00:09:23,826 --> 00:09:28,226
(The wires were the unsung heroes behind his flying scene.)

228
00:09:29,466 --> 00:09:32,766
(He went through a lot of hardships back then.)

229
00:09:33,936 --> 00:09:36,466
It looks like CGI. It looks perfect.

230
00:09:36,466 --> 00:09:37,936
No CGI was used.

231
00:09:37,936 --> 00:09:39,006
(He performed all the action scenes himself.)

232
00:09:39,006 --> 00:09:40,736
Watching it now,

233
00:09:41,136 --> 00:09:42,546
it looks like a low-budget drama.

234
00:09:43,876 --> 00:09:47,676
(It gets more surprising the more you watch.)

235
00:09:48,246 --> 00:09:49,316
Well...

236
00:09:49,316 --> 00:09:52,716
People could've been speculating that you two were dating.

237
00:09:52,986 --> 00:09:54,186
But there were no rumors.

238
00:09:54,556 --> 00:09:56,786
- Why would there be rumors? - What does it have to do with it?

239
00:09:57,226 --> 00:09:58,596
You're the only one who thinks that way.

240
00:09:58,596 --> 00:09:59,656
I mean...

241
00:09:59,656 --> 00:10:01,326
Back then, scenes like a man saving a woman...

242
00:10:01,326 --> 00:10:02,996
by transferring his energy to her...

243
00:10:02,996 --> 00:10:05,296
and then carrying her off in his arms...

244
00:10:05,696 --> 00:10:07,366
- could've sparked dating rumors. - Come on.

245
00:10:07,896 --> 00:10:11,676
In period dramas, unlike modern ones,

246
00:10:11,676 --> 00:10:15,106
even the slightest brush against each other feels so poignant.

247
00:10:17,206 --> 00:10:18,616
How disappointing.

248
00:10:19,646 --> 00:10:21,386
There's a scene I really like.

249
00:10:22,316 --> 00:10:23,346
(Curious)

250
00:10:23,346 --> 00:10:24,486
What is it?

251
00:10:24,886 --> 00:10:26,486
When you died...

252
00:10:26,756 --> 00:10:27,856
He died in the drama?

253
00:10:27,856 --> 00:10:31,156
And I cried out to him on the beach, telling him not to die.

254
00:10:31,156 --> 00:10:33,226
- Yes. - That scene is so sad.

255
00:10:34,196 --> 00:10:36,296
(I remember!)

256
00:10:36,326 --> 00:10:38,936
What? What was your line in that scene?

257
00:10:39,566 --> 00:10:41,236
All she shouted was "Young Master."

258
00:10:41,566 --> 00:10:42,806
I was supposed to be dead,

259
00:10:43,066 --> 00:10:45,606
but Ji Won kept shouting.

260
00:10:45,806 --> 00:10:47,506
My ears were hurting so much.

261
00:10:48,276 --> 00:10:49,776
"Young Master!"

262
00:10:49,946 --> 00:10:51,546
My ears were hurting so much.

263
00:10:52,576 --> 00:10:53,646
It almost killed me.

264
00:10:53,646 --> 00:10:57,386
But it was so sad, wasn't it?

265
00:10:57,586 --> 00:11:00,116
I filmed it myself,

266
00:11:00,116 --> 00:11:01,886
but I cry when I watch it again.

267
00:11:04,556 --> 00:11:07,856
(The very scene they remember differently)

268
00:11:09,326 --> 00:11:10,966
Min Jun stabbed me.

269
00:11:10,966 --> 00:11:12,966
