270
00:11:13,796 --> 00:11:15,466
But it's so sad.

271
00:11:15,766 --> 00:11:16,836
Don't kill her...

272
00:11:19,106 --> 00:11:20,936
twice.

273
00:11:20,936 --> 00:11:24,306
(He dies after leaving a heartfelt final message in the tragic scene.)

274
00:11:26,216 --> 00:11:30,446
(It's an iconic moment that has stayed with many people.)

275
00:11:32,686 --> 00:11:36,486
I had about 30 bruises on my legs back then.

276
00:11:37,226 --> 00:11:39,596
- I practically dug up the sand. - She crawled for a long time.

277
00:11:39,596 --> 00:11:41,796
(She went through a lot.)

278
00:11:41,966 --> 00:11:45,196
We filmed it without even rehearsing it properly.

279
00:11:46,196 --> 00:11:48,036
Without rehearsing it?

280
00:11:48,036 --> 00:11:49,106
(Nodding)

281
00:11:49,106 --> 00:11:51,576
We didn't have time for a rehearsal. The sun was setting.

282
00:11:51,576 --> 00:11:53,136
- I see. - Was it?

283
00:11:53,136 --> 00:11:54,776
- Yes. The sun was setting. - Was the sun setting?

284
00:11:55,546 --> 00:11:57,546
We got it done at once.

285
00:11:58,116 --> 00:11:59,776
Right. The sun was setting.

286
00:12:00,176 --> 00:12:02,586
