288
00:12:04,856 --> 00:12:06,956
A death scene like this is emotionally taxing.

289
00:12:07,416 --> 00:12:08,486
Right.

290
00:12:13,996 --> 00:12:15,196
Don't cry.

291
00:12:17,666 --> 00:12:18,796
I wanted to live...

292
00:12:21,096 --> 00:12:23,106
