293
00:12:23,166 --> 00:12:25,476
(Teary-eyed)

294
00:12:29,646 --> 00:12:36,386
(Even after all these years, the memories are still vivid as ever.)

295
00:12:38,986 --> 00:12:40,086
He's dying.

296
00:12:40,886 --> 00:12:41,986
He's dying.

297
00:12:43,926 --> 00:12:45,856
Why is he still not dead?

298
00:12:46,296 --> 00:12:48,766
(That's what matters to him the most.)

299
00:12:48,766 --> 00:12:50,726
I had to say a lot of lines before dying.

300
00:12:52,136 --> 00:12:54,466
Look. Ji Won will start screaming like crazy from now on.

301
00:12:56,966 --> 00:12:58,066
Young Master.

302
00:13:00,276 --> 00:13:02,276
Mr. Officer!

303
00:13:02,906 --> 00:13:04,776
Mr. Officer!

304
00:13:09,446 --> 00:13:12,486
(See? I told you.)

305
00:13:13,156 --> 00:13:15,686
(Screaming her lungs out)

306
00:13:16,086 --> 00:13:17,986
- Hold on. - No wonder my ears were hurting.

307
00:13:17,986 --> 00:13:18,996
(Dying of laughter)

308
00:13:19,426 --> 00:13:21,826
No wonder my ears were hurting. Look at that.

309
00:13:22,366 --> 00:13:24,726
She was shouting in my ear.

310
00:13:24,866 --> 00:13:26,666
I was literally screaming in his ear.

311
00:13:27,266 --> 00:13:29,606
I was literally screaming in his ear.

312
00:13:29,736 --> 00:13:30,836
I told you.

313
00:13:31,336 --> 00:13:33,076
I nearly went deaf.

314
00:13:33,876 --> 00:13:35,846
Mr. Officer!

315
00:13:36,246 --> 00:13:37,676
Mr. Officer!

316
00:13:37,676 --> 00:13:40,446
(Save his eardrum.)

317
00:13:41,276 --> 00:13:43,586
(Replaying it nonstop)

318
00:13:43,586 --> 00:13:46,056
That's enough to bring the dead back to life.

319
00:13:48,086 --> 00:13:49,356
I nearly went deaf.

320
00:13:49,826 --> 00:13:52,256
She was shouting in his ear.

321
00:13:53,826 --> 00:13:56,566
You sounded like a dolphin. My goodness.

322
00:13:57,566 --> 00:13:59,966
(He's a "Damo" addict starting from today.)

323
00:14:02,666 --> 00:14:03,966
Are they cremating your body?

324
00:14:04,636 --> 00:14:06,106
Yes, they are.

325
00:14:08,106 --> 00:14:12,546
