327
00:14:17,016 --> 00:14:19,286
(A gummy smile)

328
00:14:19,416 --> 00:14:21,486
Burn him!

329
00:14:24,786 --> 00:14:26,456
The cremation scene was the best part.

330
00:14:26,456 --> 00:14:28,026
