331
00:14:28,026 --> 00:14:29,666
When he returned to nature.

332
00:14:30,496 --> 00:14:31,896
The cremation scene?

333
00:14:33,396 --> 00:14:36,166
What do you like more? The death scene or the cremation scene?

334
00:14:36,606 --> 00:14:38,036
The cremation scene.

335
00:14:38,676 --> 00:14:40,706
When I turned into ashes?

336
00:14:40,806 --> 00:14:42,406
When he turned into a handful of ashes.

337
00:14:43,476 --> 00:14:44,946
Are there any other scenes from "Damo" to watch?

338
00:14:45,116 --> 00:14:47,546
This is fun.

339
00:14:48,586 --> 00:14:52,156
I didn't know talking about "Damo" would be this funny.

340
00:14:56,026 --> 00:14:59,096
It's the most heartbreaking drama...

341
00:14:59,296 --> 00:15:03,126
- I've ever filmed. Yes. - It was a heartbreaking drama.

342
00:15:03,126 --> 00:15:06,836
The title contains the phrase, "A love that pierces your heart."

343
00:15:07,866 --> 00:15:09,536
I didn't know it was this funny.

344
00:15:09,766 --> 00:15:11,336
I had no idea until now.

345
00:15:11,336 --> 00:15:12,436
(It pierced our hearts today.)

346
00:15:15,476 --> 00:15:17,906
I love "Damo."

347
00:15:19,046 --> 00:15:22,346
We had fun talking about it,

348
00:15:22,946 --> 00:15:25,686
