352
00:15:38,336 --> 00:15:42,206
I stepped into that fantasy world and lived there for a long time.

353
00:15:42,206 --> 00:15:46,106
I lived there for ten months.

354
00:15:47,236 --> 00:15:49,006
That's why it feels like a part of the life I've lived.

355
00:15:49,406 --> 00:15:53,016
I can relive those memories anytime.

356
00:15:53,016 --> 00:15:55,316
(I can relive those memories anytime.)

357
00:15:55,316 --> 00:15:57,586
You guys have a great memory.

358
00:15:57,586 --> 00:16:00,586
You remember everything, even things from over 20 years ago.

359
00:16:01,186 --> 00:16:04,786
People might be watching it again.

360
00:16:04,786 --> 00:16:07,526
A lot of people will watch the show again.

361
00:16:09,526 --> 00:16:12,536
