374
00:16:46,796 --> 00:16:47,996
It's not painful at all.

375
00:16:49,606 --> 00:16:51,936
It's very effective. I like the design too.

376
00:16:53,006 --> 00:16:54,936
I should remove my hair today...

377
00:16:54,936 --> 00:16:59,116
