383
00:17:15,226 --> 00:17:17,426
Today's only schedule...

384
00:17:18,066 --> 00:17:20,696
is filming "Kangnami."

385
00:17:21,766 --> 00:17:23,006
There's nothing else, right?

386
00:17:23,006 --> 00:17:26,806
Today is the real workday.

387
00:17:27,536 --> 00:17:28,776
How long does filming take?

388
00:17:28,776 --> 00:17:30,176
- What? - How long does it take?

389
00:17:30,176 --> 00:17:31,306
- The shoot? - "Kangnami."

390
00:17:31,306 --> 00:17:32,376
(She's especially serious about her schedule with Kangnam.)

391
00:17:32,376 --> 00:17:33,876
Everyone, this is "Kangnami."

392
00:17:33,876 --> 00:17:37,516
