411
00:18:20,326 --> 00:18:22,026
(I'll drop the honorifics then.)

412
00:18:22,026 --> 00:18:24,126
(They had nice chemistry.)

413
00:18:24,626 --> 00:18:25,666
(All of them have a connection to Kangnam.)

414
00:18:25,666 --> 00:18:27,966
Kangnam is healthy and...

415
00:18:27,966 --> 00:18:30,666
- He's so playful. - He's mischievous.

416
00:18:31,976 --> 00:18:32,976
He's so playful.

417
00:18:33,506 --> 00:18:36,046
He's quite mischievous.

418
00:18:36,046 --> 00:18:38,646
- So please stop him... - Don't worry, Ji Won.

419
00:18:38,646 --> 00:18:40,016
- before I do. - I'm an expert at that.

420
00:18:40,016 --> 00:18:41,676
Don't worry, Ji Won.

421
00:18:41,676 --> 00:18:43,246
- I'm an expert at that. - Is that so?

422
00:18:43,586 --> 00:18:45,316
- Is that so? - No need to worry about that.

423
00:18:45,316 --> 00:18:48,186
One hour later, Kangnam might cry and go home.

424
00:18:49,756 --> 00:18:52,456
(He'll stop anything for My Star today.)

425
00:18:52,926 --> 00:18:54,796
(I want to try that with you.)

426
00:18:55,226 --> 00:18:57,026
(It's too dangerous for an actress.)

427
00:18:57,026 --> 00:18:58,296
