469
00:20:20,316 --> 00:20:23,946
(He prepared a healthy smoothie for My Star.)

470
00:20:23,946 --> 00:20:25,616
(Smiling)

471
00:20:26,256 --> 00:20:27,256
(I'll get it ready right away.)

472
00:20:27,256 --> 00:20:28,956
- Did you put it in? - I'm going to.

473
00:20:30,126 --> 00:20:31,226
Let me pour this.

474
00:20:31,426 --> 00:20:32,756
And then...

475
00:20:32,756 --> 00:20:34,926
(1. Pour soy milk into the blender.)

476
00:20:35,996 --> 00:20:38,736
(2. Add a sweet banana.)

477
00:20:39,466 --> 00:20:41,666
(Super close)

478
00:20:41,836 --> 00:20:44,306
Hey, we look like a married couple...

479
00:20:44,306 --> 00:20:45,436
standing next to each other like this.

480
00:20:45,436 --> 00:20:47,536
Give me some space, will you?

481
00:20:48,706 --> 00:20:50,546
(She's loving their old-married-couple vibe.)

482
00:20:52,016 --> 00:20:54,646
