It's high in protein and fiber, so it's great for staying in shape.

486
00:21:08,456 --> 00:21:09,666
(The nutritious smoothie is perfect for My Star.)

487
00:21:10,966 --> 00:21:12,596
The best smoothie in the world.

488
00:21:16,466 --> 00:21:17,466
