489
00:21:19,206 --> 00:21:21,236
It's so nutty and rich.

490
00:21:21,906 --> 00:21:24,506
- It tastes like beans. - It's made from soybeans.

491
00:21:24,506 --> 00:21:25,546
It helps regulate blood sugar levels.

492
00:21:26,116 --> 00:21:27,916
The soybean flavor is very strong.

493
00:21:27,916 --> 00:21:29,246
(My Star loves it.)

494
00:21:29,616 --> 00:21:32,356
- It's nutty and rich. - Did you add blueberries too?

495
00:21:32,356 --> 00:21:34,016
- I added blueberries. - It's so nutty.

496
00:21:36,326 --> 00:21:40,226
