500
00:21:45,196 --> 00:21:46,236
I got married eight years ago.

501
00:21:46,236 --> 00:21:47,736
- It's been 8 years? - It's been 8 years.

502
00:21:47,736 --> 00:21:49,236
I haven't seen you for a long time.

503
00:21:49,236 --> 00:21:51,166
I can't believe you're here for a YouTube video.

504
00:21:51,166 --> 00:21:53,776
You haven't contacted me for eight years.

505
00:21:54,106 --> 00:21:56,546
