506
00:21:56,546 --> 00:21:58,206
No. I don't have your number.

507
00:21:58,206 --> 00:22:00,016
- Anyway, that's not important. - Anyway...

508
00:22:00,016 --> 00:22:01,646
Please take good care of My Star today.

509
00:22:01,646 --> 00:22:02,846
Who's My Star?

510
00:22:02,846 --> 00:22:04,046
