517
00:22:18,566 --> 00:22:20,566
No. You can't tease her too much...

518
00:22:20,566 --> 00:22:22,336
- on our show. - I can't?

519
00:22:22,336 --> 00:22:23,636
So don't go too far.

520
00:22:23,636 --> 00:22:25,166
- I got you. - Understood?

521
00:22:25,166 --> 00:22:26,836
- Understood. - Let's go. It's been a long time.

522
00:22:26,836 --> 00:22:28,746
- It's nice to see you again. - Let's go.

523
00:22:28,746 --> 00:22:30,806
(He heads off to meet My Star with a lot on his mind.)

524
00:22:31,306 --> 00:22:33,146
- Kangnam is here. - Hello.

525
00:22:33,146 --> 00:22:34,446
(Kangnam is here.)

526
00:22:34,446 --> 00:22:35,586
(A big smile)

527
00:22:35,586 --> 00:22:36,986
- Long time no see. Ji Won. - It's been a long time.

528
00:22:38,616 --> 00:22:40,416
Gosh, it's so nice to see you here.

