01:01:02,416 --> 01:01:04,216
I feel like I'm going to fall. I'm so scared.

1576
01:01:04,286 --> 01:01:05,356
Seo Jin, no.

1577
01:01:06,526 --> 01:01:07,796
I can't do it.

1578
01:01:08,156 --> 01:01:10,326
Gosh. Oh, no!

1579
01:01:10,326 --> 01:01:11,866
(My Star is shouting with her eyes closed.)

1580
01:01:11,866 --> 01:01:13,166
This is crazy.

1581
01:01:13,166 --> 01:01:14,666
Close your eyes if you're scared.

1582
01:01:17,436 --> 01:01:18,736
It's going all the way to the end.

1583
01:01:18,736 --> 01:01:20,006
No. I can't do it.

1584
01:01:20,006 --> 01:01:21,236
Hey, I can't do this.

1585
01:01:21,236 --> 01:01:22,376
I regret doing this.

1586
01:01:22,376 --> 01:01:24,706
Oh, I give up.

1587
01:01:24,976 --> 01:01:26,646
It's going so high.

1588
01:01:27,046 --> 01:01:28,476
This is crazy.

1589
01:01:28,746 --> 01:01:30,116
I can't even look.

1590
01:01:30,116 --> 01:01:31,216
This is going so high.

1591
01:01:31,216 --> 01:01:32,916
(Clacking)

1592
01:01:33,586 --> 01:01:34,916
(They're already 45m up in the air.)

1593
01:01:34,916 --> 01:01:36,356
Help me!

1594
01:01:37,386 --> 01:01:38,926
Help me!

1595
01:01:40,356 --> 01:01:41,796
(Eyes closed tightly)

1596
01:01:41,796 --> 01:01:43,756
Oh, I give up.

1597
01:01:44,126 --> 01:01:45,696
My goodness. That high?

1598
01:01:45,696 --> 01:01:48,196
(It's thrilling just to watch.)

1599
01:01:49,296 --> 01:01:50,396
Oh, my gosh.

1600
01:01:50,396 --> 01:01:51,436
(Seo Jin is the only one who is watching the view.)

1601
01:01:51,936 --> 01:01:52,936
Hey.

1602
01:01:53,536 --> 01:01:54,606
What does that mean?

1603
01:01:54,606 --> 01:01:55,606
(The green flag sign)

1604
01:01:55,976 --> 01:01:58,446
Oh, my goodness.

1605
01:01:58,506 --> 01:02:00,076
Keep your chin down. I'm going to pull now.

1606
01:02:00,676 --> 01:02:02,646
(Get ready for the drop.)

1607
01:02:02,646 --> 01:02:04,046
(Gulping)

1608
01:02:04,076 --> 01:02:05,186
I'm going to pull now.

1609
01:02:11,626 --> 01:02:15,596
(Dropping straight down at a speed of 120km per hour)

1610
01:02:18,326 --> 01:02:21,366
(Dopamine rush from just watching it)

1611
01:02:22,396 --> 01:02:24,836
(Upon dropping,)

1612
01:02:24,836 --> 01:02:28,036
(their mouths are open wide.)

1613
01:02:28,336 --> 01:02:32,306
(Eyes open wide)

1614
01:02:32,306 --> 01:02:34,716
(My Star is too scared to keep her head up.)

1615
01:02:34,716 --> 01:02:36,176
(Seo Jin next to her is...)

1616
01:02:36,176 --> 01:02:38,086
(Laughing)

1617
01:02:38,386 --> 01:02:42,056
(Followed by merciless rebound)

1618
01:02:42,456 --> 01:02:44,016
Are you okay?

1619
01:02:44,016 --> 01:02:45,056
- Yes. - Are you okay?

1620
01:02:45,326 --> 01:02:47,426
(Seo Jin, do you even care about me?)

1621
01:02:51,826 --> 01:02:53,526
You can't show your teeth.

1622
01:02:53,626 --> 01:02:54,636
(I don't know!)

1623
01:03:03,576 --> 01:03:04,776
(Screaming)

1624
01:03:04,846 --> 01:03:06,046
Their teeth are showing.

1625
01:03:06,576 --> 01:03:07,676
Their teeth are showing.

1626
01:03:07,676 --> 01:03:08,816
I feel like throwing up.

1627
01:03:08,816 --> 01:03:10,546
(Fear over fun for Team Kangnam)

1628
01:03:11,216 --> 01:03:14,486
(Doing his best not to show his teeth)

1629
01:03:15,916 --> 01:03:17,356
(My Star is starting to calm down.)

1630
01:03:17,356 --> 01:03:19,226
It was scary at first, but this is awesome.

1631
01:03:19,826 --> 01:03:21,326
Only in the beginning when it drops.

1632
01:03:22,256 --> 01:03:26,126
(On the other hand, he's still dazed.)

1633
01:03:26,426 --> 01:03:28,496
He screamed so much.

1634
01:03:29,766 --> 01:03:31,206
He was really scared.

1635
01:03:31,606 --> 01:03:33,036
When I was serving in military,

1636
01:03:33,036 --> 01:03:35,306
I jumped a lot from the mock tower...

1637
01:03:35,306 --> 01:03:37,376
for airborne training.

1638
01:03:37,376 --> 01:03:38,546
(Saying he was good at falling when he was a staff sergeant)

1639
01:03:38,646 --> 01:03:40,146
I think he's lying.

1640
01:03:40,146 --> 01:03:41,176
(I think he's lying.)

1641
01:03:41,646 --> 01:03:43,616
Did he even try rappelling?

1642
01:03:44,316 --> 01:03:45,716
Awesome.

1643
01:03:45,746 --> 01:03:46,746
- It's cool. - Look at the sea.

1644
01:03:47,716 --> 01:03:49,286
- Superman! - Get ready to do a bungee jump.

1645
01:03:49,886 --> 01:03:51,486
You have to get ready to do a bungee jump.

1646
01:03:53,726 --> 01:03:55,056
- You have to do it because of me. - I can't do it.

1647
01:03:55,096 --> 01:03:56,256
I can't do it.

1648
01:03:57,056 --> 01:03:58,296
That was crazy.

1649
01:03:59,326 --> 01:04:01,166
- Darn Kangnam. - Kangnam.

1650
01:04:01,536 --> 01:04:02,796
Darn Kangnam.

1651
01:04:03,596 --> 01:04:04,806
(Groaning)

1652
01:04:05,936 --> 01:04:07,436
Kangnam, that little...

1653
01:04:07,506 --> 01:04:09,336
This will look hilarious on TV.

1654
01:04:09,336 --> 01:04:10,836
- Seo Jin. - Yes?

1655
01:04:10,906 --> 01:04:12,506
Your face is red.

1656
01:04:12,506 --> 01:04:14,306
- The blood is rushing to my head. - Seo Jin.

1657
01:04:15,216 --> 01:04:18,616
It'll look hilarious on TV. Oh, my gosh.

1658
01:04:18,616 --> 01:04:20,886
The blood is rushing to Seo Jin's head.

1659
01:04:20,886 --> 01:04:21,916
(Groaning)

1660
01:04:22,416 --> 01:04:24,886
- I was frightened. - When we fell,

1661
01:04:25,026 --> 01:04:26,556
- Wasn't it scary? - I couldn't open my eyes.

1662
01:04:26,956 --> 01:04:28,526
It's the same as a bungee jump.

1663
01:04:30,096 --> 01:04:31,966
Seo Jin's groaning sounds weird.

1664
01:04:33,666 --> 01:04:35,536
It's harder when you have to hang here.

1665
01:04:35,536 --> 01:04:36,666
(More fragile to hanging than falling)

1666
01:04:38,266 --> 01:04:39,306
Are you going to do it?

1667
01:04:39,406 --> 01:04:40,706
I can't do it.

1668
01:04:41,376 --> 01:04:42,776
- Where are you going? - I can't do it.

1669
01:04:42,776 --> 01:04:43,806
Where are you going?

1670
01:04:44,846 --> 01:04:46,106
(Team My Star is getting ready to get off.)

1671
01:04:46,106 --> 01:04:47,276
Stand up.

1672
01:04:47,276 --> 01:04:48,416
Do we have to get up?

1673
01:04:49,546 --> 01:04:50,876
What? Do we...

1674
01:04:50,976 --> 01:04:52,346
- Wait. Do we have to get up? - Gosh.

1675
01:04:52,416 --> 01:04:53,546
What are we doing?

1676
01:04:53,746 --> 01:04:55,056
Come on.

1677
01:04:55,286 --> 01:04:57,616
Help me get up.

1678
01:04:57,616 --> 01:04:59,856
(Getting dragged)

1679
01:05:00,456 --> 01:05:02,396
Kwang Kyu.

1680
01:05:02,526 --> 01:05:04,496
- Ji Won. Help me. - Kwang Kyu.

1681
01:05:04,696 --> 01:05:06,026
- You need to get up. - Ji Won.

1682
01:05:06,026 --> 01:05:11,036
(Pulling Kwang Kyu up together)

1683
01:05:11,706 --> 01:05:14,906
(Flapping)

1684
01:05:15,406 --> 01:05:16,936
You need to get up.

1685
01:05:17,906 --> 01:05:19,306
(They successfully went on the Giant Swing.)

1686
01:05:19,306 --> 01:05:20,506
- Gosh. - You need to get up.

1687
01:05:21,076 --> 01:05:23,276
Lifting you made me sweat more.

1688
01:05:23,276 --> 01:05:24,786
Hey. Where is Kangnam?

1689
01:05:25,316 --> 01:05:26,586
Where's Kangnam?

1690
01:05:26,586 --> 01:05:28,416
- Did he run away? - He's doing it, right?

1691
01:05:28,416 --> 01:05:30,016
He ran away. See?

1692
01:05:30,016 --> 01:05:31,056
Why isn't he coming?

1693
01:05:31,056 --> 01:05:32,556
I knew he wouldn't want to ride it.

1694
01:05:32,556 --> 01:05:34,086
(Did Kangnam run off to the beach to avoid riding it?)

1695
01:05:34,186 --> 01:05:36,056
- Who... - You have to ride it.

1696
01:05:36,326 --> 01:05:37,496
- Are we making eye contact? - Yes.

1697
01:05:37,496 --> 01:05:38,866
(Trembling)

1698
01:05:39,466 --> 01:05:41,126
- Ji Won, can you walk down? - Yes?

1699
01:05:41,126 --> 01:05:42,496
Here.

1700
01:05:43,966 --> 01:05:47,036
(Still wobbling on the way down)

1701
01:05:48,776 --> 01:05:49,976
I can't bend my knees.

1702
01:05:49,976 --> 01:05:52,106
(After the drop, their legs are even shakier than before.)

1703
01:05:52,106 --> 01:05:54,846
What are we doing? Our legs are...

1704
01:05:56,876 --> 01:05:59,216
- My Star. - Really.

1705
01:05:59,286 --> 01:06:00,616
My Star, my foot.

1706
01:06:04,256 --> 01:06:05,786
I doubt I'd ever ride it again.

1707
01:06:05,786 --> 01:06:07,886
- Are you not riding it? - No.

1708
01:06:08,256 --> 01:06:09,626
At the very least, you guys ride it.

1709
01:06:09,626 --> 01:06:10,626
(Intimidated)

1710
01:06:10,626 --> 01:06:13,226
- No, he should ride it. - Kangnam has to ride it.

1711
01:06:13,596 --> 01:06:14,936
- Should we go grab him? - What?

1712
01:06:15,496 --> 01:06:16,666
I'm feeling nauseous.

1713
01:06:16,666 --> 01:06:19,536
(He has no intention of riding it.)

1714
01:06:19,706 --> 01:06:21,166
- He... - Did Kangnam really leave?

1715
01:06:21,166 --> 01:06:22,506
- You... - Stay here.

1716
01:06:22,506 --> 01:06:23,736
I'll go grab Kangnam.

1717
01:06:24,136 --> 01:06:26,106
One more. One more team. Right here.

1718
01:06:26,806 --> 01:06:27,946
He's coming.

1719
01:06:28,316 --> 01:06:29,316
Where is he?

1720
01:06:29,316 --> 01:06:30,816
(Seo Genie won't stand for anything unfair.)

1721
01:06:31,146 --> 01:06:34,616
(A rare sight of Seo Genie running)

1722
01:06:35,816 --> 01:06:36,816
Where is he?

1723
01:06:38,556 --> 01:06:39,556
Kangnam!

1724
01:06:39,556 --> 01:06:41,426
(He spotted Kangnam.)

1725
01:06:41,426 --> 01:06:43,156
Kangnam, we're late. Let's get this over with.

1726
01:06:43,426 --> 01:06:45,326
- We have enough footage. - No, hurry.

1727
01:06:46,466 --> 01:06:48,666
- Let's go. Come. - We have enough footage.

1728
01:06:48,666 --> 01:06:51,636
(Seo Jin is all smiles as he drags Kangnam back.)

1729
01:06:51,636 --> 01:06:53,466
You can do it. It's not that bad.

1730
01:06:53,466 --> 01:06:54,976
- No, it's not. - We have enough footage.

1731
01:06:54,976 --> 01:06:56,006
- No. - The writer said...

1732
01:06:56,006 --> 01:06:57,006
- we had enough footage. - No,

1733
01:06:57,006 --> 01:06:58,006
- it's not that scary. - We have...

1734
01:06:58,006 --> 01:06:59,206
- enough footage. - Stop being silly.

1735
01:06:59,806 --> 01:07:01,106
(I'm sorry!)

1736
01:07:07,046 --> 01:07:09,616
(The biggest laugh of the day)

1737
01:07:09,886 --> 01:07:12,756
(Watching the drop in person is as much of a rush as F1.)

1738
01:07:13,186 --> 01:07:15,726
(As expected, his mouth is wide open.)

1739
01:07:15,796 --> 01:07:18,566
(Pure joy)

1740
01:07:18,796 --> 01:07:20,666
No more!

1741
01:07:21,566 --> 01:07:23,636
(Laughing until they cry)

1742
01:07:23,636 --> 01:07:25,706
Kangnam's legs are spread wide.

1743
01:07:25,966 --> 01:07:27,806
Stop!

1744
01:07:29,176 --> 01:07:30,706
Please! Stop!

1745
01:07:31,876 --> 01:07:34,946
(Well, they've definitely got enough footage for YouTube now.)

1746
01:07:35,246 --> 01:07:36,316
He's back.

1747
01:07:36,316 --> 01:07:37,946
(Both teams ended up riding.)

1748
01:07:37,946 --> 01:07:39,386
- Cute. - Cute.

1749
01:07:39,386 --> 01:07:40,646
(Completely wiped out)

1750
01:07:40,646 --> 01:07:42,456
- Cute. - How did you manage to ride it?

1751
01:07:42,456 --> 01:07:43,456
What?

1752
01:07:44,486 --> 01:07:45,626
Here's your closing shot.

1753
01:07:45,626 --> 01:07:47,126
(It's a draw either way, Kangnam.)

1754
01:07:47,226 --> 01:07:48,826
- Bye. Thank you. - Thank you. Great work.

1755
01:07:48,826 --> 01:07:50,126
Thank you.

1756
01:07:50,296 --> 01:07:51,966
In 1, 2, 3.

1757
01:07:52,366 --> 01:07:54,996
Okay. Well done.

1758
01:07:54,996 --> 01:07:56,296
- Thanks. - Great work today.

1759
01:07:58,136 --> 01:08:00,436
We've got a dinner reservation. Want to go one more round?

1760
01:08:00,436 --> 01:08:02,036
- What? - We reserved a table.

1761
01:08:02,036 --> 01:08:03,406
I'm about to throw up right now.

1762
01:08:04,376 --> 01:08:05,446
- Another bet? - How about we bet on...

1763
01:08:05,446 --> 01:08:06,506
who pays for dinner?

1764
01:08:07,046 --> 01:08:08,216
What's wrong with him?

1765
01:08:08,676 --> 01:08:10,416
His eyes are scaring me now.

1766
01:08:10,416 --> 01:08:11,446
(It's been fun. Let's never do this again!)

1767
01:08:11,686 --> 01:08:12,846
Ji Won, what would you like?

1768
01:08:13,486 --> 01:08:14,486
Drinks?

1769
01:08:14,486 --> 01:08:17,216
Come on. Aren't you going to eat actual food?

1770
01:08:20,356 --> 01:08:22,126
- It's like a festival here. - Sorry?

1771
01:08:22,126 --> 01:08:24,656
The whole street is all about F1.

1772
01:08:25,866 --> 01:08:28,836
You're right. Are we in Eulji-ro?

1773
01:08:31,136 --> 01:08:32,536
This place is awesome.

1774
01:08:34,976 --> 01:08:37,236
It's like the whole country is buzzing.

1775
01:08:37,236 --> 01:08:38,876
- Totally. - Right?

1776
01:08:38,876 --> 01:08:41,546
- The whole nation is... - Yes, everyone.

1777
01:08:42,016 --> 01:08:43,616
F1 is no joke.

1778
01:08:46,546 --> 01:08:48,016
This place is worth stopping by.

1779
01:08:48,216 --> 01:08:49,616
It's a festival right here.

1780
01:08:49,756 --> 01:08:51,856
Totally, if you love F1.

1781
01:08:52,086 --> 01:08:53,126
What?

1782
01:08:55,026 --> 01:08:56,396
- It's alive. - Nice.

1783
01:08:57,026 --> 01:08:58,926
Goodness, it's a red king crab.

1784
01:09:00,396 --> 01:09:01,796
- It won't pinch me, will it? - No.

1785
01:09:01,796 --> 01:09:03,796
It's not as strong as it looks.

1786
01:09:06,536 --> 01:09:07,936
Look at the clams!

1787
01:09:08,706 --> 01:09:10,336
- What? - Look at the clams.

1788
01:09:10,606 --> 01:09:13,106
- What are they? - Those clams are huge.

1789
01:09:13,106 --> 01:09:14,376
- They're clams? - Yes.

1790
01:09:14,946 --> 01:09:16,716
Try this. It's the real deal.

1791
01:09:16,716 --> 01:09:18,916
- Isn't it a bit much? - No, it's good.

1792
01:09:18,916 --> 01:09:19,946
- Is it? - Yes.

1793
01:09:21,556 --> 01:09:22,616
That's how you drink it.

1794
01:09:22,756 --> 01:09:24,016
It's actually good.

1795
01:09:24,556 --> 01:09:25,556
It's good.

1796
01:09:26,886 --> 01:09:27,986
Those look tasty.

1797
01:09:28,526 --> 01:09:30,396
The seasoning is on point.

1798
01:09:31,456 --> 01:09:33,196
- There are noodles. - My gosh.

1799
01:09:33,426 --> 01:09:36,036
I'm a picky eater when I'm overseas, but this is actually good.

1800
01:09:36,036 --> 01:09:37,266
(Making the most of Singapore's flavors)

1801
01:09:37,266 --> 01:09:39,366
- You've got to eat here. - It's delicious.

1802
01:09:39,436 --> 01:09:41,136
- Amazing. - It's a must-try.

1803
01:09:42,036 --> 01:09:43,836
- This one's good. - Is it?

1804
01:09:46,006 --> 01:09:49,016
My Star, it's been 30 years, right?

1805
01:09:49,016 --> 01:09:50,846
- What? - Since you started acting.

1806
01:09:51,016 --> 01:09:53,016
- Thirty years? Yes. - Right?

1807
01:09:53,016 --> 01:09:54,116
(Already in her 31st year as an actor)

1808
01:09:54,116 --> 01:09:55,486
Of all the roles you've played...

1809
01:09:55,786 --> 01:09:58,586
in those 30 years, which is your favorite?

1810
01:09:58,656 --> 01:10:00,326
- My favorite role? - Your favorite role.

1811
01:10:01,026 --> 01:10:02,126
Besides "Damo."

1812
01:10:02,126 --> 01:10:04,196
(Besides "Damo.")

1813
01:10:04,196 --> 01:10:06,226
I can't leave "Damo" off the list.

1814
01:10:06,226 --> 01:10:08,026
I see. Is it that meaningful?

1815
01:10:08,096 --> 01:10:10,766
The role aside,

1816
01:10:10,766 --> 01:10:13,766
as an actor, you want to enjoy being on set.

1817
01:10:14,436 --> 01:10:16,376
That was the first drama that made me realize...

1818
01:10:16,376 --> 01:10:18,276
how much fun being on set could be.

1819
01:10:18,576 --> 01:10:19,706
- "Damo" did? - Yes.

1820
01:10:20,046 --> 01:10:22,376
Seo Jin keeps saying how tough it was.

1821
01:10:22,376 --> 01:10:25,616
Listen, Kwang Kyu. "Damo..."

1822
01:10:25,986 --> 01:10:27,916
took my career...

1823
01:10:28,716 --> 01:10:30,416
to the next level.

1824
01:10:30,416 --> 01:10:32,526
- You took the elevator up. - Correct.

1825
01:10:33,026 --> 01:10:34,726
Back then... I'm sure Ji Won remembers it too.

1826
01:10:34,956 --> 01:10:37,996
Every morning, I felt like waking up in a whole new world.

1827
01:10:38,366 --> 01:10:41,026
People were crazy about the drama.

1828
01:10:41,396 --> 01:10:42,966
It was just the beginning.

1829
01:10:43,566 --> 01:10:44,696
I'm jealous.

1830
01:10:46,866 --> 01:10:48,006
It was fun.

1831
01:10:48,266 --> 01:10:49,306
Totally.

1832
01:10:49,736 --> 01:10:51,706
Do that at her fan meeting.

1833
01:10:52,276 --> 01:10:53,676
- At Ji Won's fan meeting? - Yes.

1834
01:10:53,906 --> 01:10:55,376
- Do what? - "Does it hurt?"

1835
01:10:55,676 --> 01:10:56,846
- No way. - "Does it hurt?"

1836
01:10:57,216 --> 01:10:58,416
Come on.

1837
01:11:00,116 --> 01:11:02,556
No, I can't. Over my dead body.

1838
01:11:02,556 --> 01:11:05,256
What's so hard about saying it?

1839
01:11:05,256 --> 01:11:07,686
I've never said it outside the drama.

1840
01:11:08,286 --> 01:11:10,196
Say, "Does it hurt?" while giving this to her.

1841
01:11:10,196 --> 01:11:13,926
(Even when his older bestie asked)

1842
01:11:13,926 --> 01:11:17,166
(Even when My Star asked)

1843
