(Seo Jin refused to say the famous line.)

1844
01:11:20,666 --> 01:11:22,436
I can't do it in such a crowded place.

1845
01:11:24,106 --> 01:11:27,406
It's not a scene you can just reenact anywhere, you know?

1846
01:11:29,176 --> 01:11:31,246
Even for 100,000 dollars or more, I'd hesitate.

1847
01:11:33,016 --> 01:11:36,516
Seriously, you have no clue, right?

1848
01:11:37,656 --> 01:11:39,526
Think about how much work the production crew puts in.

1849
01:11:39,826 --> 01:11:40,956
I can't do it here.

1850
01:11:42,096 --> 01:11:43,756
If you want me to do it...

1851
01:11:45,666 --> 01:11:48,566
Ji Won, do you remember your line from that scene?

1852
01:11:48,636 --> 01:11:50,796
Which scene? The "Does it hurt? It hurts me too" one?

1853
01:11:50,796 --> 01:11:53,236
I said, "Do not hurt me." After that line,

1854
01:11:53,706 --> 01:11:55,206
your line was really long.

1855
01:11:55,236 --> 01:11:56,906
Right.

1856
01:11:57,706 --> 01:11:59,476
I'll do it if she can say that line.

1857
01:11:59,746 --> 01:12:00,976
If Ji Won can say her line.

1858
01:12:01,576 --> 01:12:03,516
- Will you really do it? - No.

1859
01:12:03,516 --> 01:12:04,646
I think you can if Ji Won memorizes her line.

1860
01:12:04,646 --> 01:12:07,046
We can't do it here. I'd rather die than do it here.

1861
01:12:07,046 --> 01:12:08,116
Fine.

1862
01:12:09,156 --> 01:12:11,516
- See that? - "Sir, since I was seven..."

1863
01:12:11,516 --> 01:12:12,526
Ji Won's line...

1864
01:12:12,526 --> 01:12:13,526
- was much longer than mine. - No way.

1865
01:12:19,596 --> 01:12:21,766
Is it over? Is the race over?

1866
01:12:21,766 --> 01:12:24,796
(The race ends, and the F1 finale fireworks suddenly light up.)

1867
01:12:26,806 --> 01:12:27,866
Ji Won.

1868
01:12:27,866 --> 01:12:29,176
(On photo duty)

1869
01:12:29,176 --> 01:12:30,336
Ji Won!

1870
01:12:37,416 --> 01:12:38,646
Nice.

1871
01:12:38,646 --> 01:12:40,346
(A dreamlike night in Singapore draws to a close.)

1872
01:12:40,346 --> 01:12:42,356
We're getting quite a fireworks show tonight.

1873
01:12:42,956 --> 01:12:44,316
And we're this close, to boot.

1874
01:12:44,316 --> 01:12:46,056
(A surprising behind-the-scenes is coming up.)

1875
01:12:47,042 --> 01:12:50,352
The fireworks are going off to welcome Ji Won.

1876
01:12:50,352 --> 01:12:51,682
Did you two set them up?

1877
01:12:51,922 --> 01:12:53,822
- I ordered the fireworks. - You did?

1878
01:12:54,622 --> 01:12:57,392
The fireworks keep saying,

1879
01:12:57,692 --> 01:13:01,292
"Does it hurt? It hurts me too."

1880
01:13:01,292 --> 01:13:02,732
Yes, they're saying it.

1881
01:13:02,862 --> 01:13:06,032
(How badly does he want to hear that famous line from "Damo?")

1882
01:13:09,832 --> 01:13:12,302
- Great work. - Great work.

1883
01:13:12,372 --> 01:13:14,002
In 1, 2, 3.

1884
01:13:14,972 --> 01:13:16,342
Thank you so much.

1885
01:13:16,342 --> 01:13:17,472
(The My Genie Secretary shoot is done.)

1886
01:13:17,472 --> 01:13:18,542
It was so much fun.

1887
01:13:19,582 --> 01:13:21,812
(And a few hours later)

1888
01:13:23,352 --> 01:13:27,352
(Why did they suddenly turn the camera back on at the wrap party?)

1889
01:13:27,782 --> 01:13:31,022
It looked really familiar, and it just popped into my head.

1890
01:13:31,022 --> 01:13:33,162
(Ju Shin Jung)

1891
01:13:33,262 --> 01:13:36,062
We had the "Damo" wrap party at Ju Shin Jung.

1892
01:13:37,392 --> 01:13:39,832
You mean the Ju Shin Jung in the basement in Yeouido, right?

1893
01:13:39,832 --> 01:13:41,162
- Yes, that one. - Right?

1894
01:13:41,162 --> 01:13:43,202
Remember the name of the veteran actor?

1895
01:13:43,802 --> 01:13:45,642
- Yong... - Kim something used to run it.

1896
01:13:45,702 --> 01:13:47,902
- Kim Jong Kyeol! - Yes, it was him.

1897
01:13:47,902 --> 01:13:50,012
Come to think of it, a lot of wrap parties were held at his restaurant.

1898
01:13:50,012 --> 01:13:51,012
Totally.

1899
01:13:51,012 --> 01:13:52,912
- At Kim Jong Kyeol's restaurant. - It was famous.

1900
01:13:52,912 --> 01:13:56,382
But I rarely went to wrap parties at Ju Shin Jung.

1901
01:13:56,382 --> 01:13:57,612
He's Kim Jong Kyeol.

1902
01:13:57,612 --> 01:14:00,352
As far as I remember, "Damo" was the only show I wrapped there.

1903
01:14:00,482 --> 01:14:02,452
- I rarely went there. - Only...

1904
01:14:02,452 --> 01:14:04,652
the biggest hits had their wrap parties...

1905
01:14:04,652 --> 01:14:06,722
- at that restaurant. - Right.

1906
01:14:06,722 --> 01:14:08,222
- Yes. - I remember it.

1907
01:14:08,222 --> 01:14:10,932
- Wasn't it a beef place? - It was in a basement in Yeouido.

1908
01:14:11,332 --> 01:14:13,132
We had our "Damo" wrap party there!

1909
01:14:13,132 --> 01:14:14,632
- Kim Jong Kyeol? - It's...

1910
01:14:14,632 --> 01:14:15,672
- Kim Jong Kyeol? - closed now.

1911
01:14:15,672 --> 01:14:17,502
And now we're having our wrap party at Ju Shin Jung too!

1912
01:14:17,902 --> 01:14:20,272
- Exactly. - I got goosebumps.

1913
01:14:20,742 --> 01:14:21,812
Unbelievable.

1914
01:14:22,412 --> 01:14:24,312
"In 2003, the hit drama 'Damo' held..."

1915
01:14:24,312 --> 01:14:26,242
- "its wrap party..." - For real?

1916
01:14:26,242 --> 01:14:27,882
"at Ju Shin Jung,"

1917
01:14:27,882 --> 01:14:30,382
"a popular barbecue restaurant in Yeouido..."

1918
01:14:30,382 --> 01:14:35,252
"run by actor Kim Jong Kyeol."

1919
01:14:35,252 --> 01:14:37,152
- That's amazing. - It's written right here.

1920
01:14:37,152 --> 01:14:39,692
- We're at Singapore's Ju Shin Jung. - Singapore's Ju Shin Jung.

1921
01:14:40,362 --> 01:14:42,362
(The Korean restaurant Kwang Kyu wanted to eat at)

1922
01:14:42,362 --> 01:14:44,332
- I can't believe he remembered. - It's amazing that he remembered.

1923
01:14:44,332 --> 01:14:45,702
Your memory is unbelievable.

1924
01:14:45,702 --> 01:14:47,832
This has to be a sign that you should say that line.

1925
01:14:49,902 --> 01:14:52,542
- Do you mind turning the music off? - Can you turn the music off?

1926
01:14:52,942 --> 01:14:54,702
We can prepare Chae Ok's line right away.

1927
01:14:55,002 --> 01:14:56,512
Please turn the music off.

1928
01:14:57,042 --> 01:14:58,442
There's even a hanok over there.

1929
01:14:58,442 --> 01:15:00,612
(Taking it one step further)

1930
01:15:01,342 --> 01:15:02,552
The sketchbook.

1931
01:15:02,552 --> 01:15:04,252
(Quickly getting the lines ready)

1932
01:15:04,652 --> 01:15:07,222
(Quickly setting up the camera)

1933
01:15:08,322 --> 01:15:09,452
Frame both of us like this.

1934
01:15:11,422 --> 01:15:14,662
(Why are you suddenly so into it?)

1935
01:15:15,562 --> 01:15:16,632
- Are you getting us both? - Yes.

1936
01:15:16,632 --> 01:15:19,032
(Back to where it all began, 23 years ago)

1937
01:15:19,032 --> 01:15:21,062
"It's been 15 years since I met you."

1938
01:15:21,062 --> 01:15:23,572
(Reunited as Hwangbo Yoon and Jang Chae Ok)

1939
01:15:25,272 --> 01:15:29,512
(A special treat for "Damo" addicts who've waited 23 years)

1940
01:15:29,972 --> 01:15:33,342
Get into position. Ready. Action.

1941
01:15:33,342 --> 01:15:34,342
(Recreating the iconic scene from episode 1 of "Damo")

1942
01:15:41,892 --> 01:15:45,422
(Embarrassed)

1943
01:15:46,292 --> 01:15:47,562
Seriously.

1944
01:15:49,592 --> 01:15:51,362
You dug your own grave, Seo Jin.

1945
01:15:51,362 --> 01:15:53,362
Ju Shin Jung is to blame for all of this.

1946
01:15:53,562 --> 01:15:55,502
- Ju Shin Jung. - Why is it Ju Shin Jung?

1947
01:15:56,032 --> 01:15:57,702
I'm only doing this for Ju Shin Jung.

1948
01:16:03,542 --> 01:16:04,542
Does it hurt?

1949
01:16:04,542 --> 01:16:08,652
(Does it hurt?)

1950
01:16:08,652 --> 01:16:09,752
Yes.

1951
01:16:12,922 --> 01:16:13,922
It hurts me too.

1952
01:16:13,922 --> 01:16:17,822
(It hurts me too.)

1953
01:16:17,822 --> 01:16:19,292
Before you are my subordinate,

1954
01:16:20,862 --> 01:16:22,092
you are like a sister to me.

1955
01:16:22,092 --> 01:16:24,592
(Before you are my subordinate, you are like a sister to me.)

1956
01:16:25,762 --> 01:16:26,762
I...

1957
01:16:27,362 --> 01:16:28,732
I haven't finished my lines yet.

1958
01:16:32,102 --> 01:16:34,602
I'm sorry. Let's do it again.

1959
01:16:34,602 --> 01:16:35,742
It was nice.

1960
01:16:35,742 --> 01:16:37,972
- Let's do it again. It was nice. - Good.

1961
01:16:37,972 --> 01:16:39,142
You're starting to feel it.

1962
01:16:40,259 --> 01:16:41,299
I...

1963
01:16:42,269 --> 01:16:43,399
I haven't finished my lines yet.

1964
01:16:46,699 --> 01:16:49,239
I'm sorry. Let's do it again.

1965
01:16:49,239 --> 01:16:51,769
It was nice. Let's do it again.

1966
01:16:51,769 --> 01:16:53,879
- It was nice. - Good. You're starting to feel it.

1967
01:16:54,209 --> 01:16:56,449
- Get a grip. - Ready. Action.

1968
01:17:01,319 --> 01:17:02,319
Does it hurt?

1969
01:17:02,319 --> 01:17:06,319
(Does it hurt?)

1970
01:17:06,319 --> 01:17:07,319
Yes.

1971
01:17:11,329 --> 01:17:12,429
It hurts me too.

1972
01:17:12,429 --> 01:17:15,529
(It hurts me too.)

1973
01:17:18,869 --> 01:17:20,499
Before you are my subordinate,

1974
01:17:22,239 --> 01:17:23,369
you are like a sister to me.

1975
01:17:23,369 --> 01:17:26,809
(Before you are my subordinate, you are like a sister to me.)

1976
01:17:27,939 --> 01:17:29,309
Do not hurt me.

1977
01:17:31,679 --> 01:17:32,719
Since...

1978
01:17:34,879 --> 01:17:38,819
I was seven, I have been protecting you by your side.

1979
01:17:41,059 --> 01:17:43,759
I would lay down my life for you,

1980
01:17:45,289 --> 01:17:47,299
but I cannot stand in your way.

1981
01:17:49,769 --> 01:17:52,099
I have served you for 15 years.

1982
01:17:52,569 --> 01:17:55,239
(The scene that pierced our hearts all those years ago)

1983
01:17:55,239 --> 01:17:56,639
I know better than anyone...

1984
01:17:56,639 --> 01:17:57,969
(Bringing those emotions of Yoon and Chae Ok to life again)

1985
01:17:57,969 --> 01:17:59,809
how much you have suffered.

1986
01:18:02,149 --> 01:18:03,809
I cannot bear to see your dream...

1987
01:18:04,849 --> 01:18:06,949
come to nothing because of me.

1988
01:18:13,289 --> 01:18:14,859
I have no wish to fulfill my dream...

1989
01:18:17,659 --> 01:18:19,629
at the cost of sacrificing you.

1990
01:18:19,629 --> 01:18:22,199
(I have no wish to fulfill my dream at the cost of sacrificing you.)

1991
01:18:44,419 --> 01:18:46,089
Amazing.

1992
01:18:46,089 --> 01:18:48,389
(We actually did it.)

1993
01:18:48,689 --> 01:18:50,489
We won!

1994
01:18:52,629 --> 01:18:53,899
From what I see...

1995
01:18:53,899 --> 01:18:55,299
