1999
01:19:00,869 --> 01:19:02,509
("Damo" addicts finally get their wish after waiting for 23 years.)

2000
01:19:02,509 --> 01:19:04,409
- Through My Genie Secretary. - Through My Genie Secretary.

2001
01:19:05,439 --> 01:19:07,239
Weren't you dead set against it earlier?

2002
01:19:07,239 --> 01:19:08,849
