2003
01:19:08,849 --> 01:19:10,779
Had it not been for Ju Shin Jung, I wouldn't have done it.

2004
01:19:10,779 --> 01:19:11,979
- Exactly. - Gosh.

2005
01:19:11,979 --> 01:19:13,019
I got goosebumps.

2006
01:19:13,019 --> 01:19:15,079
It felt like it was meant to be.

2007
01:19:15,079 --> 01:19:18,089
- It felt like fate. - Totally.

2008
01:19:18,219 --> 01:19:19,489
Nice.

2009
01:19:20,189 --> 01:19:22,459
Ji Won and I weren't this close when we filmed "Damo."

2010
01:19:23,189 --> 01:19:24,759
Were we ever this close?

2011
01:19:25,389 --> 01:19:27,329
We only saw each other on set...

2012
01:19:27,599 --> 01:19:28,829
when we were filming.

2013
01:19:30,169 --> 01:19:32,199
We never really...

2014
01:19:32,839 --> 01:19:33,969
spent time together.

2015
01:19:33,969 --> 01:19:37,509
Ji Won and I got to talking while we watched F1 yesterday.

2016
01:19:37,509 --> 01:19:40,309
It made me wonder if we'd ever gotten that personal before.

2017
01:19:40,309 --> 01:19:41,679
(Reunited after 23 years, they're finally getting to know each other.)

2018
01:19:41,679 --> 01:19:45,309
People get closer when they travel together.

2019
01:19:46,049 --> 01:19:48,019
I feel like spending...

2020
01:19:48,019 --> 01:19:50,889
a few days together brought Ji Won and me closer.

2021
01:19:51,219 --> 01:19:55,119
When we were shooting "Damo..."

2022
01:19:55,119 --> 01:19:56,529
(What was it like to reunite with Lee Seo Jin after 23 years?)

2023
01:19:56,529 --> 01:19:58,559
I only remembered him as the officer.

2024
01:19:58,559 --> 01:20:02,829
I barely knew him as a person.

2025
01:20:03,129 --> 01:20:07,199
Once the drama wrapped, that was it.

2026
01:20:07,199 --> 01:20:10,109
But on My Genie Secretary,

2027
01:20:11,039 --> 01:20:13,979
I got to know him as Lee Seo Jin.

2028
01:20:15,239 --> 01:20:17,609
That's part of what made it so much fun.

2029
01:20:18,879 --> 01:20:21,349
- Thank you. - Thank you.

2030
01:20:21,349 --> 01:20:22,389
Thank you.

2031
01:20:22,389 --> 01:20:24,489
(Fate)

2032
01:20:24,749 --> 01:20:27,649
(I wore the brightest thing I had.)

2033
01:20:28,042 --> 01:20:30,042
(We haven't been in touch for 5 years.)

2034
01:20:30,382 --> 01:20:32,552
(Has spring come for Kwang Kyu in the middle of this chilly fall?)

2035
01:20:32,852 --> 01:20:35,182
(She's my granddaughter.)

2036
01:20:35,182 --> 01:20:36,622
Hi, I'm Hwasa.

2037
01:20:36,622 --> 01:20:37,822
(My Star Hwasa)

2038
01:20:37,952 --> 01:20:39,052
("First Female K-pop Soloist to Captivate 80,000 Crowd in Brazil")

2039
01:20:39,052 --> 01:20:40,122
("Even NVIDIA CEO Jensen Huang is a Fan")

2040
01:20:40,122 --> 01:20:42,122
(A K-pop star recognized around the world)

2041
01:20:42,122 --> 01:20:43,392
(Do we carry the receiver around?)

2042
01:20:43,392 --> 01:20:44,792
(Are these both mics?)

2043
01:20:44,792 --> 01:20:46,632
(Is taking care of My Star a world-class challenge too?)

2044
01:20:46,632 --> 01:20:47,962
(Managers,)

2045
01:20:47,962 --> 01:20:48,962
(can you carry me?)

2046
01:20:48,962 --> 01:20:50,162
(Carry you how?)

2047
01:20:50,162 --> 01:20:52,572
(Going full backup dancer for My Star)

2048
01:20:52,572 --> 01:20:55,032
(There's something I'd like to do with you two.)

2049
01:20:55,332 --> 01:20:57,042
(Matching nails. Are you in?)

2050
01:20:57,042 --> 01:20:58,812
(Are we also getting our nails done?)

2051
01:20:59,912 --> 01:21:02,442
(Gosh, they're so smooth.)

2052
01:21:02,712 --> 01:21:04,082
(I'm getting nail extensions.)

2053
01:21:04,212 --> 01:21:06,452
(The more they help My Star, the more they get into it.)

2054
01:21:06,452 --> 01:21:07,882
(My hands look gorgeous.)

2055
01:21:08,052 --> 01:21:09,052
(My hands are sparkly.)

2056
01:21:09,052 --> 01:21:10,922
(I'd love for you to join me for the finale.)

2057
01:21:11,152 --> 01:21:13,822
(A showdown for a spot as a "Good Goodbye" dancer?)

2058
01:21:13,922 --> 01:21:16,092
