2059
01:21:16,092 --> 01:21:17,462
(The press interview hasn't even started?)

2060
01:21:17,462 --> 01:21:18,522
(It's going to take 40 minutes?)

2061
01:21:18,522 --> 01:21:19,792
(Cut it to 30 minutes.)

2062
01:21:19,792 --> 01:21:21,632
(Let's hurry a little, please!)

2063
01:21:21,862 --> 01:21:23,832
(Standby time is getting closer.)

2064
01:21:23,832 --> 01:21:25,702
- Should the next team go first? - Yes.

2065
01:21:26,132 --> 01:21:29,072
